<title>HUNGARY: Hungary three-mth BUBOR rates drops, six-mth rises.</title>
<headline>Hungary three-mth BUBOR rates drops, six-mth rises.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's three-month Budapest Interbank Offered Rate (BUBOR) dropped one basis point on Tuesday, while the six-month rate firmed two basis points, the National Bank of Hungary said on its  BUBOR Reuters page.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 20.50 percent, unchanged, the three-month rate at 20.12 percent and the six-month rate at 19.73 percent.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
